ALS Downloader's compatibility code in app.js is original application code.

The author portrait is supplied from Cesar Alvites' own public website repository,
with his authorization for this application. It is not provider imagery.

The banner is a procedural point-cloud illustration created for this project,
not a rendered provider dataset. Its SVG source is retained in report/banner.svg;
the repository history records its creation and the maintainer's chosen version.
Real-data documentation figures have separate provenance in docs/README_FIGURES.md.
